#ntdiff PRIVATE/NTOS/DD/SERIAL/SOURCES
#crlf
+!IF 0
=1 4 12
+    This is the serial driver of the communications and printer lines of
+    the DZ serial line multiplexer of the DECstation 5000/200 (KN02): the
+    serial driver of ..\serial over the DZ port driver.  The sources that
+    do not touch the hardware are those of ..\serial.
=1 22 6
+TARGETNAME=dzserial
=1 29 3
+INCLUDES=..\..\inc;..\serial
+
+SOURCES=
